    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On August 30, 2025, a special event took place under the Oriental Pearl TV Tower in Shanghai. Claude Brouir, a 63-year-old man from Belgium "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Belgium",
            "zh": "比利时"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", arrived after riding more than 12,000 kilometres from Brussels "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Brussels",
            "zh": "布鲁塞尔"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on a solar tricycle "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "solar tricycle",
            "zh": "太阳能三轮车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". People in Shanghai welcomed him warmly with cheers and flowers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Brouir began his trip on April 19. For over 120 days, he rode across mountains, rivers, and wide fields in Europe and Asia. His journey was not only for fun; it was also a dream he had "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cherished",
            "ref": "v-cherish"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a long time: to build a closer connection with China."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The idea started in November 2024. Brouir planned to come to Shanghai to visit his eldest son, who had moved there. Brouir joined a cycling event and was touched by the kindness of local riders. “That trip gave me the idea: Why not ride all the way from Brussels to Shanghai?” he said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To follow his belief in green travel, Brouir used a special solar tricycle. It had two "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "motors",
            "ref": "v-motor"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and four solar panels "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "solar panels",
            "zh": "太阳能板"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The bike also pulled a trailer "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trailer",
            "zh": "拖车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " carrying his tent and daily things. With the help of the panels, he could climb hills without fuel. Along the way, he saw many beautiful places and often received help from strangers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The year 2025 "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "marks",
            "ref": "v-mark"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the 50th anniversary of China-E.U. relations, which makes his arrival even more meaningful. Brouir said the busy streets and friendly people of Shanghai made him feel at home. “Coming here is not the end,” he smiled. "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "“It is a new beginning.”"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " At the ceremony, officials praised his spirit. They said Shanghai would always welcome friends from Europe and serve as a bridge of friendship connecting people."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
